<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92646" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοιβδ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>move with a whistling</i> or <i>rustling sound</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοιβδοῦσα κόλπον αἰγίδος</span>
			<i>letting</i> the swelling aegis <i>rustle</i> (as she flies),
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				404
			</span></i>: intr., of wind, <i>whistle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοιβδήσας Εὖρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.636
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Crin.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>suck down</i>, of Charybdis, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				12.106
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα δ᾽ ἐρροίβδει μέγα σύνεγγυς ἡμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ezek.
					<u>Exag.</u>
					237
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				46(3).38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cause to gush forth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν . . κρηναῖον ἐξ ἄμμοιο-ήση
					γάνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					247
				</span></i>
			. (In signf. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυβδέω</span> shd. perh. be written, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναρροιβδέω</span>; signf. <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> is found also in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορροιβδέω,
				ἐπιρροιβδέω</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
</div>